{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:82cdf61b8e2bf68657cd5822477fdeca568559c2d6d6db12975f4ea1b1f4c0b7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83f68ddf38e7b557a57f40e1d9510c27e3e502b63261c3c043019783d22c6834",
      "text": "衣锦还乡Mega荣归",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ca8808c595764c6f8671d07bf0a7060ce9e3bb835f77788d74bda80f7b206d3",
      "text": "四季确定要出演与他颇有渊源的青森当地的活动。\n能站在曾经作为观众仰望过的舞台上，他兴奋不已。\n到了活动当天，面对令人怀念的会场雀跃不已的四季\n面前出现了一个人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:83f68ddf38e7b557a57f40e1d9510c27e3e502b63261c3c043019783d22c6834",
      "text": "衣锦还乡Mega荣归",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bcc3b90781b7221410f39116bb9aa9c61f962284ed979b620bff57e20e21561",
      "text": "辛苦啦，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec419eda149e79e1dd3e2249244e32eedf47ed8af91c88c1c28b918798c807f8",
      "text": "敲定新工作了对吧……\n咦？今天只有我一个人吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28d6cd2968d2616b54c1b93972b2a9c22722832435e5f5f1263bb4cfe93e3d23",
      "text": "是的，没错。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0d08385eed556706cf636c4e762cb3df48173cbbd874abb0181416c47b2a6db",
      "text": "原来是这样啊！\n那么，是什么样的工作呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed6ff00e2578b8fe4bfeeaeb2c5ae4fa7886ffe772ec68e52b3c58865f02eb93",
      "text": "这次的工作是去地方活动演出，\n地点是……青森！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fd50836a262911cde0733d643e49e5abc7a9065b782de0478d1bd665547eff9",
      "text": "……哎？哎哎——！？\n真、真真真的假的啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f477f36276f546040caf30616ef8c690712acaa6556849cc0258f758d34890f",
      "text": "是的！是真的！关于活动的详情\n请看这里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc8ca92f3d4801c01af6ce145d72fe6aaf9fdf39d37a21d482a99fe5ab3874de",
      "text": "哇——我知道这个活动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27c5d732837b8e95f92f5e9c1d674c2b650029d0f18cb0b160caad30aacf4a61",
      "text": "没想到会因为工作去青森！\n得赶紧告诉奶奶他们……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23023da970ea1a957ca0f000d9317a6a77d0b7d0e3337fbefb2f1073d3657a4c",
      "text": "啊，解禁情报之前不能说！\n这里必须咬牙忍住……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:716a55cebfe8a4d177c07dc95df4bbb98feb1649ebe5f1534996b5bb7ab4ef47",
      "text": "活动的公布日期已经定下来了，\n网站公开后我马上就通知你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_a:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d31a055f7331e6ce637ae76b1c2997bc03694f6274926f2521f7bcfd072d92b5",
      "text": "太好啦！我要用马赫般的速度联络奶奶！\n呜呜～好期待啊～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6903fc720dce3f035864ae78cabbd584b180f4a1c4d1a8f1df51c5e1d3110b",
      "text": "活动当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d47a279c8e46dce108ca22df1e815b00cb7483bd00952b38ec657c245874cca3",
      "text": "这里就是今天的活动场地了。\n……四季先生，看起来很高兴呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47c4c1d945bdc574392eade4d266d67aae73e981f3aa580939f0cb658586c3c8",
      "text": "真的很让人怀念啊。不管是摊位还是舞台……\n哇——！好激动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4df0c217ff7214628711d2c27664474f9735c5c0767718a845691a398ac92dd",
      "text": "……没想到我居然也会有站在这个舞台上的一天。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbbeef890974115b3aa27463b939227a097b2f297c7241f56c4d1ffc50487b3a",
      "text": "我初中时因为各种原因没能加入社团……\n都是一个人听着新歌去唱卡拉OK呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f9930a45249186554764ea96c787092e12088398da4c8b944a47d32585cce8",
      "text": "那个时候我也来过这个活动哦。\n现场听到喜欢乐队的演出超兴奋的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ef46f8e6a346f3ee1468c1f773fe833c0e42592cc18b2b14e19c876a23755fda",
      "text": "所以总觉得很自豪！\n真想告诉那个时候的自己啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e680779bf0882656d7136a607bc8b8875a663abd5b919a8071d0069eb3819b3",
      "text": "今天的迷你Live和脱口秀，我会加油的！\n请一直注视着我哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a10a30b01185a4fb88de8048b826ead330a4eefa668efe763867de2301e84b47",
      "text": "好的，当然了。\n我会为你加油的，四季先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a03382f46efdfd48ff23df9ba50e6a1a5ce2f0e38e5f44e0a070a6571dd0cc7",
      "text": "好久不见啦，四季酱。\n过得还好吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:754f2b79d8fc38d87835ca9a2ee5e562f47346fcdd2d4612f1c26789699362d1",
      "text": "啊……奶奶！\n你来看我了啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_c:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:12fcbae49d7e91f6ca69dc3e8ed7655a92a1fd6aa00ecd033f63d86782d28d31",
      "text": "孙子的大日子怎么能不来呢。\n这是衣锦还乡了呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d6ba34f85e596dd90782625de793d303b88df8e6ac9529cbbf640c83bef4e70",
      "text": "谢谢你！我这就去好好表现！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02a74305037e3a7fb8f309b6fed4b4e7abcafcacc0990aecc2fb56266df2fb7d",
      "text": "是嘛。\n加油啊四季酱。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5914c897ae781d443c1895b3d9076f0580f0cc9f8ce36e657074145e6c040e9",
      "text": "初次见面。我是负责四季先生制作工作的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffa17b115c8160cb39f1a151669b5882f99e1dab5206f53494da9537951f2aea",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6821baa40cec0f2e720f88d01e447d095c389129f5ec6d8de1b40aca9a1c1489",
      "text": "四季酱承蒙您照顾了。\n我总听孙子提起您呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:004487199f68ae0e17af20ce167a7b96faec525a9702a0dc0b713aba5fdc9448",
      "text": "每次都讲得可开心了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2db76e5a112e874b4c6d8e087eb85e27c4f1ea6727e898549e592e1e11b99b66",
      "text": "差、差不多该去休息室了，\n●●●●プロデューサー酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b72a87a3e4ac9ef776f78a9e4e23661970b2ffb60c0cc54d0198f7296477f0d6",
      "text": "必须去跟客户打个招呼才行！\n还要开会呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:865f4fa690605fa69c28aaad80d17cb0cc5afed9f5d5f38c757b7b18a6cdbba8",
      "text": "奶奶等着我哦！\n我会让你看到我超帅的一面的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78b2075ea7fcb7e80e823e34810cc079fa038cbedfd5a29fe03c134c5b18549e",
      "text": "活动开始",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:239d5087efc27109bad5082aba7d66b4ea86796eeea64b18c1a02191890384ef",
      "text": "大家好——！气氛嗨起来了吗——！\n容我再次自我介绍，我是High×Joker的伊濑谷四季！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81741276cdc5684bfc5d1a66813012d79f87a4f30e077a96f0589f80b624ed3b",
      "text": "我以前也来过这个活动哦！\n所以能被邀请，超级超级开心！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e06d937da20c46b5dbeb49a7ee49a90a488d23e8e5d5edf5d2323c3435c2796f",
      "text": "虽然今天只有我一个人，但平时我和超绝Mega\n厉害的前辈们5个人一起活动！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0bc74cac57f81805b192e13effdfb4918d8f1523dd2134ded4bfa9abde48f28",
      "text": "知道High×Joker的人！\n请举手——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86323d2e29e02276325f861da1b964300c2cc561796fe25af65bbaa7fe44b07f",
      "text": "喔～！？有这么多人知道我们……！\n好开心！Thank you啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2296ac497bf9f02a73ebe1fa1d02a7af474d1bb759e4d567109fadedc5cd3eb1",
      "text": "（四季先生的谈吐真是状态绝佳呢。\n台下的气氛也超级热烈）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63d00df2bf6b25e209ef40adf118d39ad27d06782b8071a170e22987089ea9cd",
      "text": "（而且……四季先生的祖母看起来\n也很开心。真是太好了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2bb3dc22df49eb9d9e006c6cb6345f2667dc6f9989a767a1f98706c1cc8b9f8",
      "text": "……总而言之，我们最近要出新歌的CD，\n大家可以去听听看哦……话虽如此！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddef774fc03868d95d2074d2dd5b2157afa6d3c54defa8d300e6653504475485",
      "text": "虽说想一直这么聊下去，\n不过时间好像差不多到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_d:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96e72f1ec261e7564be912c3fdcf42cf1ef13185ede935aa8ae9e726aa857576",
      "text": "最后就用这首歌向大家道别吧！\n那么，要上咯！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_e:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:798d1ea127f4c3bbf76d684501ed53f3f28a717e76cf0ed69a76eb1e8dc18bb4",
      "text": "哈～不仅给前辈们买了一堆伴手礼，\n这次的工作也Mega开心啊～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9177af476c69fe64e0492da26d8297ceadddf9c838a18fb4ff6e14dbb1bca96",
      "text": "会场的大家也都很享受四季先生的脱口秀和Live！\n大获成功呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8d12e4662cd41002eac38195737241fd5a543ed1343120d4db0bd7b8e412c89",
      "text": "客户那边也大受好评。\n还说务必希望你再去呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72ef1e713d7d2717ea9cc250321b1685a8b0436d16194ecb05a3f2f6e8333eb4",
      "text": "真的假的！？去去去！\n绝对还要再去演出！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab4f7cb80a1c2f5a96a833888dd445ed9a1d13cc5c407e83c82c5d1caad9a621",
      "text": "就像四季先生的祖母说的那样，\n我们下次再去衣锦还乡吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e915a4070eebff0df93155001b7964d48e71a408747a5ae451af72ddcc01b94e",
      "text": "锦衣……对啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6022b101600afa8e4182249321cabac73a57cc274fd7afcc2d5852ddea19759",
      "text": "我……不对，我们还要变得更大牌，\n然后举办单独的全国巡演！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_e:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2938e28de1f51df0182f90f3a70c68ba6deff311f9728881c1e0be6ff83905e8",
      "text": "到了那时候，要带着Mega Mega大的锦衣\n回来荣归故里！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_e:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24fa8abc2c92f4eb00c70bb4c22163400d257d447ae6a6a84c5547108aa831c2",
      "text": "为此●●●●プロデューサー酱！\n今后的制作工作也拜托了☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_024shk_01_1_2_024_01:1_2_024_01_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc38cf7847c4e3be25c1a33e32c22261c6bbf3b787c1e1ebde61d8350832eed7",
      "text": "好的！让我们一起织就\n更加华丽的锦衣吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
